{
  "info": {
    "title": "Flight Status API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "<div className=\"jj-nav\">\n  <a className=\"jj-nav-brand\" href=\"/flight-status-api/introduction\">\n    <span className=\"jj-nav-mark\">JJ</span>\n    <span className=\"jj-nav-name\">JSON Jet Airways</span>\n  </a>\n  <nav className=\"jj-nav-links\">\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link\" href=\"/flight-status-api/introduction\">Home</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link jj-nav-active\" href=\"/flight-status-api/flight-status/get-flight-status\">API Explorer</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link\" href=\"mailto:api@jsonjetairways.example\">Contact</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link jj-nav-cta\" href=\"/checkin-demo\">CheckIn Demo</a>\n  </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"jj-api-banner\">\n  <div className=\"jj-api-eyebrow\">JJ &middot; RESTown Hub &middot; API v1.0</div>\n  <div className=\"jj-api-h\">Flight Status API</div>\n  <p className=\"jj-api-p\">Real-time flight intelligence, wrapped in comfort. One REST call returns the\n  complete live state of any JSON Jet Airways flight.</p>\n</div>\n\nDemo API for looking up the current status of a flight by carrier code and flight number.\n\nSupport: JSON JET Airways API Team &mdash; api@jsonjetairways.example"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "flight-status"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/flight-status": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "flight-status"
        ],
        "summary": "Get flight status",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "carrierCode",
                    "flightNumber",
                    "status",
                    "departureAirport",
                    "arrivalAirport",
                    "scheduledDeparture",
                    "estimatedDeparture",
                    "scheduledArrival",
                    "estimatedArrival",
                    "gate",
                    "terminal",
                    "lastUpdated"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "gate": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "terminal": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "carrierCode": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "lastUpdated": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "flightNumber": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "arrivalAirport": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "departureAirport": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "estimatedArrival": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "scheduledArrival": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "estimatedDeparture": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "scheduledDeparture": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "gate": "{{$headers 'gate' 'B12'}}",
                  "status": "{{$headers 'status' 'DELAYED'}}",
                  "terminal": "{{$headers 'terminal' '4'}}",
                  "carrierCode": "{{$headers 'carrierCode' 'JJ'}}",
                  "lastUpdated": "{{$headers 'lastUpdated' '2026-07-28T13:05:00Z'}}",
                  "flightNumber": "{{$headers 'flightNumber' '202'}}",
                  "arrivalAirport": "{{$headers 'arrivalAirport' 'LAX'}}",
                  "departureAirport": "{{$headers 'departureAirport' 'JFK'}}",
                  "estimatedArrival": "{{$headers 'estimatedArrival' '2026-07-28T18:25:00Z'}}",
                  "scheduledArrival": "{{$headers 'scheduledArrival' '2026-07-28T17:45:00Z'}}",
                  "estimatedDeparture": "{{$headers 'estimatedDeparture' '2026-07-28T15:10:00Z'}}",
                  "scheduledDeparture": "{{$headers 'scheduledDeparture' '2026-07-28T14:30:00Z'}}"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Flight status retrieved successfully."
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "code",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "code": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "code": "INVALID_FLIGHT_NUMBER",
                  "message": "Flight number must consist of numbers only. Expected pattern: ^[0-9]{1,4}$"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Missing or invalid carrierCode / flightNumber."
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "code",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "code": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "code": "FLIGHT_NOT_FOUND",
                  "message": "No flight found for carrier JJ, flight number 404."
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "No flight found for the given carrierCode / flightNumber."
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "carrierCode",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9]{2}$",
              "default": "JJ"
            },
            "example": "JJ",
            "description": "Two-letter IATA carrier code (e.g. `JJ` for JSON JET Airways)."
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "flightNumber",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,4}$",
              "default": "202"
            },
            "example": "202",
            "description": "Numeric flight number without the carrier code, 1-4 digits (e.g. `202`).\nUse `404` to simulate a not-found response; letters such as `abc` return a 400."
          }
        ],
        "description": "<div className=\"jj-nav\">\n  <a className=\"jj-nav-brand\" href=\"/flight-status-api/introduction\">\n    <span className=\"jj-nav-mark\">JJ</span>\n    <span className=\"jj-nav-name\">JSON Jet Airways</span>\n  </a>\n  <nav className=\"jj-nav-links\">\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link\" href=\"/flight-status-api/introduction\">Home</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link jj-nav-active\" href=\"/flight-status-api/flight-status/get-flight-status\">API Explorer</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link\" href=\"mailto:api@jsonjetairways.example\">Contact</a>\n    <a className=\"jj-nav-link jj-nav-cta\" href=\"/checkin-demo\">CheckIn Demo</a>\n  </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"jj-api-banner\">\n  <div className=\"jj-api-eyebrow\">Flight Status API &middot; v1.0</div>\n  <div className=\"jj-api-h\">GET /flight-status</div>\n  <p className=\"jj-api-p\">Returns the complete live state of a single flight &mdash; status, gate, terminal,\n  and both scheduled and estimated times &mdash; identified by carrier code and flight number.</p>\n  <div className=\"jj-api-chips\">\n    <span className=\"jj-api-chip\">x-api-key auth</span>\n    <span className=\"jj-api-chip\">ISO 8601 UTC</span>\n    <span className=\"jj-api-chip\">IATA codes</span>\n    <span className=\"jj-api-chip\">Public sandbox</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n**Authentication.** Send your key in the `x-api-key` header. Paste it into the Authorization\nfield above and the Explorer will attach it to every request.\n\n**Sandbox triggers.** `flightNumber=404` returns `FLIGHT_NOT_FOUND`. A non-numeric value such as\n`flightNumber=abc` returns `INVALID_FLIGHT_NUMBER`. Anything else returns a healthy `200`.",
        "operationId": "getFlight-status",
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "flight-status"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "Get flight status"
      }
    }
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://fef3af9d-2af6-417d-9153-30ea3eb9ad46.mock.pstmn.io",
      "description": "Public sandbox (Postman mock)"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApiKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "x-api-key",
        "description": "Your JSON Jet Airways API key, sent on every request."
      }
    }
  },
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKeyAuth": []
    }
  ]
}
